OL,13,G2006 The Documentary
OL,14,     FThere are more than 730 sinkholes
OL,15,     Fin central Turkey, and their
OL,16,     Fnumbers are surging, threatening
OL,17,     Ffarmland and food supplies. They
OL,18,     Fare nature's response to
OL,19,     Funsustainable water use.
